  <!-- ============ OVERVIEW ============ -->
    <section class="mb-4">
    <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Project Overview</h2>
    <div class="text-body"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;"><font face="Times New Roman"><span style="font-size: 18px;">Sai Dham Landmark is a commercial project
located in heart of the city. It is located at Elgin Road, Civil Lines (near
Yash Hospital), Prayagraj. On being located at prestigious location of
Prayagraj the project promises high financial gains and returns to its investors and owners.</span><o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%;"><font face="Times New Roman"><span style="font-size: 18px;">This project comprises of service apartment,
retail space and office space. It also consists of banquet hall and roof top
restaurant. It is a first of its kind project in Prayagraj. </span><o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;">

</span><span style="font-size: 18px;">

</span><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 115%;"><font face="Times New Roman">Sai Dham Landmark is accompanied with all must have amenities
like basement parking, high speed automatic elevators, round the clock water
supply, 24/7 power back up and 24/7 security.</font></span><br></p></div>
  </section>
  
